# ── Contact form (Web3Forms) ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to ".env" and paste your own access key below.
#
# To get a key (takes ~1 minute, free, no password):
#   1. Go to https://web3forms.com
#   2. Type the email that should RECEIVE the enquiries:
#        Waralak.t@outlook.com
#   3. Press "Create Access Key" — the key is emailed to that address
#   4. Paste it below, then restart the dev server
#
# The key is safe to expose in the browser — that's how Web3Forms is
# designed. It can only ever deliver mail to the address it was made for.

VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=paste-your-access-key-here
